      ],
      "source": "https://woodlandparkneighborhood.org/rooted-in-nature-the-history-and-heritage-of-woodland-park-norfolk-s-hidden-gem/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Woodland Park Elementary, founded in 1958 along Woodland Drive, became the community’s daily life center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
