      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://woodlandparkneighborhood.org/rooted-in-nature-the-history-and-heritage-of-woodland-park-norfolk-s-hidden-gem/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Woodland Park Community Garden, at Spruce Street and Maple Court, became a welcome resource for residents young and old.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
